      `the first condition is satisfied` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the second condition is taken to be satisfied under sub-paragraph (7)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the second condition is satisfied under sub-paragraph (3)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 3 pt I para 5 the contribution conditions for the benefit are satisfied` MEANS
