-- src:4823 | (i) from so much of the claimant’s earnings as did not exceed the upper earnings limit and upon which primary Class 1 contributions have been paid or treated as paid or from earnings credited; or
-- src:4824 | (ii) from Class 2 contributions; and
-- src:4825 | (b) if the year in question is an earlier year, from the contributions referred to in paragraph (a) of that sub-paragraph.
